(property "Description" "Johnson sonraki durum (3.1, 3.6): Q1' = NAND(Q2, NAND(STOP, Q1)) (= !Q2 | STOP&Q1, 2 kapı); Q2' = NAND(/Q1, /WAIT); /WAIT, 138'in G1 = Q2 ucu sayesinde zaten OR(/WAIT, /Q2). 4. kapı /GO = NAND(sync2, /prev) (3.3). PLAN DÜZELTMESİ (PLAN_FIXES[0])." (at 58.42 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
